# Normal day: no alerts, daily summary at 06:00, uploads every 5 min, stage change and status by SMS
present: seri-tool 0\.\d+\.\d+ \(SIM x60\) booting
in-order: SMS to 9876543210: Shed-1: OK\s*$
in-order: PRINTER\| ======= DAILY SUMMARY =======
in-order: PRINTER\| \d\d/11 \d\d:\d\d STAGE -> Instar 4
in-order: SMS to 9876543210: Shed-1: OK - Instar 4
in-order: SMS to 9876543210: Shed-1: 25\.0C 70% Instar 4 \d\d:\d\d
count >= 3: MQTT PUBLISH seri/Shed-1/data
absent: LOG E,\d+,\w+,Start
absent: SMS to .*(HIGH|LOW|fault|cut|low|finished)
